# stat: rooms, objects and characters. In the temple (3001): Smokegod (60), Seraph (56), Decimus (10), Pickpocket (13,
# who envenoms a small sword, 3021: an object affect with a duration) and Hassan (3011, a mob with a special procedure
# and a spell affect). Rooms: the temple, 1206 (with extra descriptions, private and for implementors only, so Seraph
# is refused) and 3005. Objects, each statted with its own lines: a pink potion (105), a small wand (106), a burnt
# staff (1327), a water skin (3138, drink), a meat cleaver (1355, a weapon with flags), a dagger with attack 40 (the
# closing row of attack_table: "(null)"), leather pants (3062, armour), a leather backpack (1345, a container that
# lightens what's in it), herbs with an extra description (300), glasses (101, a prototype affect with no bits) and
# winged sandals (904, a prototype affect with bits, and invisible: Smokegod sees them with holylight on). "stat NAME"
# tries an object, then a character, then a room.
